notes: |
  Four orthogonal fixes to mobile (412×900) layout that
  wavecode-preset-row-and-toast-z left incomplete:

  1. **Toast above all fixed rows.** --z-toast 50 → 80.
     Toast now stacks above modal=60 and all fixed rows
     (preset-row=53, controls-row=52). Visual guarantee:
     error/critical/info toasts always visible, never
     covered by Play panel. TopBar buttons around toast
     remain clickable (pointer-events:none on stack,
     pointer-events:auto on .toast-item).

  2. **preset-row visually transparent.** Removed
     background, border-bottom, backdrop-filter from
     .app-preset-row. Only the <select> with its own
     outline remains. controls-row is now the sole visual
     frame of the command bar; its border was moved from
     bottom to top so the divider sits at the top of the
     controls row instead of duplicated between two rows.

  3. **Mobile cm-content font-size 12px → 11px** under
     @media (max-width:720px). line-height 1.4. On a
     412px viewport this gives one more visible line
     without losing readability (Retina @3x, 11px ≈ 33
     CSS px²).

  4. **MiniNotationToolbar collapsed by default on
     mobile.** ScorePanel wraps <MiniNotationToolbar> in
     <Show when={miniToolbarOpen()}>; default
     readMiniToolbarOpen(isDesktop) — closed on mobile,
     open on desktop. localStorage 'wavecode-mini-toolbar-v1'
     overrides. New '✎ snippet' chip in .score-debug row
     toggles the state with aria-pressed + data-active.
     Net effect: cm-host goes from ~46px (1-2 lines) to
     ~216px (5-6 lines) on a 412×900 viewport with the
     split-pane sheet open.

